Bill's base cam

898
01:17:16.030 --> 01:17:18.030
is on one of the island's building

899
01:17:18.050 --> 01:17:20.050
Finding out which one,
I leave to you, Mouse.

900
01:17:25.980 --> 01:17:27.980
Got it.

901
01:17:28.000 --> 01:17:30.000
